290:- **Profile earnings (D-81 F10):** **₹20 per confirmed prescription** (Apurva, 2026-11-02), so 3 prescriptions today show Earned ₹60.00 · Incentive ₹0.00 (0 while setting availability). The app shows what the backend sends; earnings count once a case is confirmed (D-73). Incentive rules are not defined yet (₹0.00 in the prototype).
323:## 12. Open questions (not for the rebuild to invent)
329:## 13. Round 4 — consistency audit and pinned bar (2026-11-02, Apurva's decisions)
333:**Pinned action bar (item 1).** Every pinned main action sits in the action bar: case page, Prescribe, Home, faster sign-in offer, returning unlock. The content above the bar scrolls on short phones; the bar never covers the last content at the end of the scroll; toasts sit above the bar. Sign-in and OTP keep their main button inline under the fields (RULES §8.4).
345:**Gaps and cards.** Cards that stack are 16 apart on the case page, Prescribe and Profile (B-05, A-13, B-04). Notices and their controls: 8 (A-14).
353:**Other audit items (B-07, B-08, B-09 … B-24, A-08, A-10, A-11, A-12, A-15, A-16, A-20)** are in the sections above where they apply: Home, Prescribe and the case page. A-08 (spinner gap) is 8 on every busy button, set centrally.
357:**Small-phone check and Round 4 items for Prescribe:** `d-default`, `t01-ready`, `s7d-result-missing`, `t12-transfer-ready`, offer and unlock at 360×640 (see the Round 4 report).
359:**Header edge (B-07, Round 5).** In the compact task header, the edit header (Prescribe) and the viewer header (Rx), Back / ✕ is a 48px target whose glyph starts on the 16px margin; the title starts 54px from the edge on all three, the same as the sheet ✕ and the compact header.
